!! _POC-XRL3VPN XR02(VPNv4 のルート リフレクタ候補・XRd)。転送の道には入らない(RT03 の先の行き止まり)。
!! IS-IS CORE だけ。LDP なし。BGP(VPNv4)は PoC の段で足す。
interface Loopback0
 ipv4 address 10.255.0.21 255.255.255.255
!
interface {{ links[3] }}
 description RR-LINK to RT03
 ipv4 address 10.0.33.21 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 is-type level-2-only
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0021.00
 log adjacency changes
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  metric-style wide
 !
 interface Loopback0
  passive
  address-family ipv4 unicast
  !
 !
 interface {{ links[3] }}
  point-to-point
  address-family ipv4 unicast
   metric 10
  !
 !
!
end
